      "verified": true,
      "purpose": "THE ODDS FEED for this bookmaker. A \"lobby container\" is a curated bundle of events with their markets and prices. Verified containers carrying prematch football 1X2 include 4155, 4136, 4146, 4147, 4161, 4162, 4169, 4170, 4204, 4988, 5087, 5161, 5170. Shape: {events:{id:{sportId, homeTeam, awayTeam, startTime, live, markets:[{marketTemplateName, marketTitle, outcomes:[{name, odds}]}]}}}. The match RESULT market is the one whose outcome names are 1 / X / 2 — note that other three-way markets exist and are NOT 1X2 (e.g. \"Golul (3)\" is goals within 3 minutes). Prematch means live === false."
    },
