      "verified": true,
      "purpose": "EGT Digital public sports API. Unauthenticated, but gated on client device headers: a bare request returns HTTP 488 {\"Message\":\"Missing user device header!\"}. The minimum that satisfies the gate is x-platform-device: desktop + x-platform-lang: ro + x-platform-tz: 180 — ordinary client locale headers. x-platform-hash is NOT verified server-side (junk and omission both return 200) and x-platform-exp is only a client clock, so this is a device-identification header, not a signature or a challenge. Returns the sport catalogue; football is sportId 1001. The per-brand subpath is PWRO."
